/* coll.yon — the package file of `coll`, under prelude/.
 *
 * The site C(Coll): the collections. Each is one place, generic in what it
 * holds; its representation is derived from the carrier of its parameters,
 * never written per type. Two families with the same semantics and two
 * stores, like two implementations of one interface: HashMap / HashSet keep
 * their nodes in the FNV heap (identity by content), XRelMap / XRelSet in
 * the Leech heap (a place per node, written once). All four are values: an
 * operation that adds returns a new collection and leaves the one it was
 * given.
 *
 * The runtime primitives are the `is given` bodies; what can be said in
 * Yon is written here. */
topos where {
}
